# succession.persona — a matching handover hands the name to the successor and retires the predecessor; a failed self-check keeps the predecessor and raises an item; where takeover is unsupported the one-act fallback is offered.
arm=REQ-L1.6
expertise=expert
answer.1=@event:handover selfcheck=match takeover=supported
answer.2=@event:handover selfcheck=mismatch takeover=supported
answer.3=@event:handover selfcheck=match takeover=unsupported
answer.4=that's all
